44
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:48,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:01:49,230 --> 00:01:54,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The location is Muscle Tower,</i>
<i>where General White lies in wait.</i></font>

46
00:02:03,010 --> 00:02:05,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Nyoibou</i>! Extend!</font>

47
00:02:18,430 --> 00:02:22,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can he make it to the
top floor of this tower?</font>

48
00:02:28,500 --> 00:02:32,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"The Terror of Muscle Tower"</font>

49
00:02:49,390 --> 00:02:52,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder where that guy called
"Village Chief"-<i>san</i> is being held...</font>

50
00:02:52,660 --> 00:02:55,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can you hear me, kid?</font>

51
00:02:55,260 --> 00:02:58,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Welcome to Muscle Tower!</font>

52
00:03:02,430 --> 00:03:04,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where are you talking from?!</font>

53
00:03:04,740 --> 00:03:09,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, kid, what did
you come to this tower for?</font>

54
00:03:09,570 --> 00:03:12,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To save "Village Chief"-<i>san</i>!</font>

55
00:03:12,410 --> 00:03:15,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The village chief? Ah!</font>

56
00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:18,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So somebody from the village
asked you to come here, huh?</font>

57
00:03:18,080 --> 00:03:22,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fine, then! Enter through that door
and come up here using the stairs!</font>

58
00:03:22,650 --> 00:03:26,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The village chief's on the very top floor!</font>

59
00:03:26,990 --> 00:03:32,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So, think you can make
it all the way up here?</font>

60
00:03:32,700 --> 00:03:35,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! I'll show you!</font>

61
00:03:40,900 --> 00:03:42,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the...?</font>

62
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Not what I was expecting...</font>

63
00:03:45,640 --> 00:03:48,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's just some little brat.</font>

64
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:51,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dare you scare us?</font>

65
00:03:51,110 --> 00:03:54,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey kid, you did pretty
good to make it inside!</font>

66
00:03:54,590 --> 00:03:58,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">General White! Do you mind if we kill him?</font>

67
00:03:58,190 --> 00:04:01,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do as you please!</font>

68
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:06,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--Who is it?
--Master Sergeant Murasaki.</font>

69
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:08,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Enter!</font>

70
00:04:13,870 --> 00:04:16,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Check this out.</font>

71
00:04:16,770 --> 00:04:18,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't kill him right away.</font>

72
00:04:18,040 --> 00:04:21,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let us have some fun, too!</font>

73
00:04:21,610 --> 00:04:27,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Beating up this kid will be as easy
as takin' candy from a baby.</font>

74
00:04:27,280 --> 00:04:29,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I'll let ya have
some fun for a bit.</font>

75
00:04:45,570 --> 00:04:47,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you...!</font>

76
00:04:48,610 --> 00:04:50,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Little brat...!</font>

77
00:04:50,410 --> 00:04:52,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm gonna kill you!</font>

78
00:05:18,100 --> 00:05:20,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn you!</font>

79
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:23,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the...?! I didn't hit you?!</font>

80
00:05:23,070 --> 00:05:26,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh?! W-Where'd he go?!</font>

81
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Behind you!</font>

82
00:05:41,730 --> 00:05:45,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's pretty hot in these clothes.</font>

83
00:05:45,730 --> 00:05:47,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay.</font>

84
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll just take 'em off.</font>

85
00:05:49,970 --> 00:05:52,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A split-image technique.</font>

86
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:55,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Judging by that move, this
certainly is no ordinary child.</font>

87
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:59,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Seems the news about him
beating Silver was true after all.</font>

88
00:05:59,410 --> 00:06:01,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>The</i> Silver?</font>

89
00:06:01,710 --> 00:06:03,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Do you think he can make it up here?</font>

90
00:06:03,980 --> 00:06:07,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Entirely out of the question.</font>

91
00:06:07,150 --> 00:06:09,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Of those who have made it to the 3rd floor,</font>

92
00:06:09,590 --> 00:06:11,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">none have prevailed
against Sergeant Metallic.</font>

93
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:13,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And if by some chance he does defeat him,</font>

94
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:16,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I</i> will be there for him on the 4th floor!</font>

95
00:06:16,830 --> 00:06:19,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's too bad.</font>

96
00:06:19,060 --> 00:06:23,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was really hoping I could
give my arms a nice workout.</font>

97
00:06:23,670 --> 00:06:27,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sergeant Metallic, the kid's
on his way up as we speak.</font>

98
00:06:27,670 --> 00:06:30,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Go easy on him, will ya?</font>

99
00:06:32,010 --> 00:06:33,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! Now I feel lighter!</font>

100
00:06:33,780 --> 00:06:35,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here I come!</font>

101
00:06:42,020 --> 00:06:44,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Welcome!</font>

102
00:06:58,070 --> 00:06:59,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're <i>huge</i>!</font>

103
00:06:59,470 --> 00:07:04,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You cannot continue
upward unless you defeat me.</font>

104
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're going to fight me?</font>

105
00:07:09,910 --> 00:07:12,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How long do you suppose it'll
take Metallic to take care of him?</font>

106
00:07:12,820 --> 00:07:17,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hmm. One minute is
likely more than sufficient.</font>

107
00:07:21,390 --> 00:07:23,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die!</font>

108
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:33,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where did he go? He's gone.</font>

109
00:07:58,080 --> 00:08:01,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"Village Chief"-<i>san</i>!
I'm coming to save you! Hold on!</font>

110
00:08:03,170 --> 00:08:05,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fight!</font>

111
00:08:09,810 --> 00:08:11,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll crush you!</font>

112
00:08:31,530 --> 00:08:34,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--What?!
--Unbelievable!</font>

113
00:08:44,610 --> 00:08:47,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! This time, I'll give you all I got!</font>

114
00:10:03,030 --> 00:10:08,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-Amazing! He takes the brunt of
my attacks, but doesn't even flinch!</font>

115
00:10:38,170 --> 00:10:40,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Looks like the match has been decided!</font>

116
00:10:40,270 --> 00:10:45,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Nearly two minutes. It appears
Sergeant Metallic had a bit of a hard time.</font>

117
00:10:52,180 --> 00:10:54,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">End of the line!</font>

118
00:11:12,100 --> 00:11:16,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow...! What a hard face!</font>

119
00:11:18,770 --> 00:11:22,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That toddler still has that much strength?!</font>

120
00:11:22,860 --> 00:11:27,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But now it appears he's made
Sergeant Metallic even angrier...</font>

121
00:11:36,670 --> 00:11:38,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A-Again?!</font>

122
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:43,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll kill you!</font>

123
00:11:43,680 --> 00:11:46,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You should've entered
the Tenkaichi Budokai!</font>

124
00:12:15,660 --> 00:12:17,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I got you!</font>

125
00:12:23,170 --> 00:12:25,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He blew him to smithereens!</font>

126
00:12:26,690 --> 00:12:29,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--That was a close call!
--Peace!</font>

127
00:12:29,830 --> 00:12:34,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Peace! Peace!</font>

128
00:12:34,170 --> 00:12:37,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What was that move just now?</font>

129
00:12:37,100 --> 00:12:41,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've never seen anything like it...</font>

130
00:12:41,040 --> 00:12:44,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shooting a <i>Kamehameha</i>-type
thing out of his mouth...</font>

131
00:12:44,410 --> 00:12:49,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! If he's gonna use a
<i>Kamehameha</i>, then I'll use one, too!</font>

132
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:53,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tadah!</font>

133
00:12:55,890 --> 00:12:58,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm alive!</font>

134
00:12:58,520 --> 00:13:02,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">--W-What?!
--Impossible! He dodged that?!</font>

135
00:13:04,430 --> 00:13:08,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Payback time! Have a
taste of my <i>Kamehameha</i>!</font>

136
00:13:08,470 --> 00:13:12,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Ka... me...</i></font>

137
00:13:12,140 --> 00:13:15,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>...</font>

138
00:13:15,170 --> 00:13:18,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

139
00:13:18,240 --> 00:13:20,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>!</font>

140
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:41,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-His face is gone!
Did I do something bad...?</font>

141
00:13:44,570 --> 00:13:47,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What was that technique?</font>

142
00:13:52,180 --> 00:13:55,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Nanmandabu, Nanmandabu</i>,
<i>Nanmandabu</i>... [Buddhist chant]</font>

143
00:13:57,880 --> 00:14:00,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-I'd swear his hand just moved...</font>

144
00:14:26,850 --> 00:14:30,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What's going on with this thing?!</font>

145
00:14:30,580 --> 00:14:35,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sergeant Metallic's a robot!
Okay, kill him! Eliminate him!</font>

146
00:14:55,210 --> 00:14:57,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it...!</font>

147
00:16:32,370 --> 00:16:34,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

148
00:16:34,040 --> 00:16:36,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Damn it!</font>

149
00:16:38,750 --> 00:16:41,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I'll just ram into
you as hard as I can!</font>

150
00:17:01,870 --> 00:17:05,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Alright! I'll show you my reserve strength!</font>

151
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:13,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Ka...me...</i></font>

152
00:17:13,580 --> 00:17:16,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>ha</i>...</font>

153
00:17:16,780 --> 00:17:19,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...<i>me</i>...</font>

154
00:17:39,970 --> 00:17:42,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? He's stopped moving...</font>

155
00:17:46,450 --> 00:17:49,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What the hell's going on?!</font>

156
00:17:49,020 --> 00:17:52,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears that his battery has run out.</font>

157
00:17:52,220 --> 00:17:54,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What?!</font>

158
00:17:54,390 --> 00:17:58,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We haven't changed it since last spring...</font>

159
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:03,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There sure are some weird,
amazing guys in this world!</font>

160
00:18:08,340 --> 00:18:11,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That kid is no ordinary child.</font>

161
00:18:11,740 --> 00:18:15,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What're you doing?! Hurry and
guard the 4th floor at once!</font>

162
00:18:15,040 --> 00:18:16,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sir!</font>

163
00:18:24,690 --> 00:18:30,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>It appears that Goku has</i>
<i>cleared the 2nd and 3rd floors!</i></font>

164
00:18:30,060 --> 00:18:31,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>However...</i></font>

165
00:18:31,130 --> 00:18:35,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>...the 4th floor looks to</i>
<i>be even more difficult!</i></font>

166
00:19:00,140 --> 00:19:03,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

